  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brochure raising awareness on circular agriculture in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This brochure titled &quot;Kenya and the Netherlands Working Together Towards a Circular Agriculture in Kenya&quot; gives a practical outline of the fundamentals of circular agriculture in Kenya, combined with several examples of Kenyan and Dutch commercial initiatives. This brochure aims to create awareness of circular agriculture and to show the benefits for the Kenyan public- and private sectors. The Netherlands&apos; ambition is to be a leader in circular agriculture and wants to work with other countries. This publication will show examples of Dutch companies, farms and organizations or Dutch technologies on circular agriculture implemented in Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
